			"notes": {
				"rationale": "The es of a clock time refers to nothing and stays in every word order (Jetzt war es halb zwölf), so it is not positional; it joins the verb as its expletive subject (de/expletive-es-joins-its-verb), and war stays apart from the time predicate (de/copula-stays-apart). Ruled on #743 (MB-B5, A5). The copula of a clock time (Es war gegen halb 12 Uhr) is the gold copula Reading 🟰."
			},
